# team-roster v2: the event log is append-only (one line per event),
# so git's union merge driver — take lines from both sides — is safe
# here and ONLY here. Never use merge=union on record files: two
# agents editing the same claim/feature file MUST conflict, so a human
# (or the hook) sees it. This file is part of the team tree — copy it
# together with roster/, claims/, features/.
events.jsonl merge=union
events-archive/*.jsonl merge=union
